  <scopecontent id="d9e6d7a2d1440d7618710e564136484c">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>This collection is comprised of select Laurance S. Rockefeller and Mary French Rockefeller cashbooks, contributions, ledgers, household account books, business account books, receipts and disbursements, expenditures, trial balances, and securities.</p>  </scopecontent>
